    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>it just feels like a losing game though. like i'm just running on a treadmill that never stops, waiting for a feeling of \"home\" that isn't coming. the more i try to connect, the more i realize how far away i actually am from everyone. it's just... there's no point in fighting against something that's so fundamentally broken in me. it's just a lot of noise for no reason.",
